// spec/agentOrchestrator/index.md, "Story: Direct an authorized task to the intended subagent and evaluate its result"; spec/agentOrchestrator/index.md, "Only the owner directs coding agents, and a message without a session id reaches only its own room's subagents"; spec/agentOrchestrator/sessionAdmission.md, "A turn completes only when the agent itself ends it"; spec/agentOrchestrator/taskLifecycle.md, "Story: Track an orchestrated coding task from creation through verified completion"; spec/agentOrchestrator/lanesAndRouting.md, "Multi-lane wave execution prevents scope collisions and enforces concurrency and budget caps"; spec/agentOrchestrator/lanesAndRouting.md, "Multi-lane wave execution prevents scope collisions and enforces concurrency and budget caps"
